### Get Lingo by ID - Valid Request
GET http://localhost:5003/api/lingos/12345abcdef
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Lingo by ID - Non-existent ID (Should return 404)
GET http://localhost:5003/api/lingos/nonexistentid123
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Lingo by ID - Empty ID (Should return 400)
GET http://localhost:5003/api/lingos/
Content-Type: application/json
